uen"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"A good viewpoint on the town and the valley, especially on sunsets. It can be reached from the south gate of the medina (Bab el-Ain) by climbing the road coasting the medina on the west side until the east gate (Bab Souk), and then uphill, crossing the old cemetery on a rocky path.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Chaouen1_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-Chaouen1_-_panoramio.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Chaouen1_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Chaouen1_-_panoramio.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Antoni Pons Oliver","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chaouen1_-_panoramio.jpg"}},{"id":"chefchaouen_wv_ecomuseum_of_talassemtane_national_park","areaId":"chefchaouen","name":"Ecomuseum of Talassemtane National Park","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":35.17501,"lng":-5.2645},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"chefchaouen_wv_ecomuseum_of_talassemtane_national_park","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["ecomuseumoftalassemtanenationalpark","chefchaouen"],"hours":{"week":[null,{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Closed Mon; Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Smallish museum showcasing fauna and flora of Talassemtane National Park. Introduces the park itself as well as provides with hiking maps.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen"},{"id":"chefchaouen_wv_restaurant_oum_rabie","areaId":"chefchaouen","name":"Restaurant Oum Rabie","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":35.16721,"lng":-5.26436},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"chefchaouen_wv_restaurant_oum_rabie","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://web.facebook.com/OumRabie","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["restaurantoumrabie","chefchaouen"],"hours":{"week":[null,{"open":"12:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Closed Mon"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"The only bar in town. Wines, beers, hard liquors. Prices for alcohol is 2-3 times higher than in store (but bear in mind the closest shop selling alcohol is Auchan in Tetouan, 1.5 hr drive away). A few small plates with simple food are served per table free of charge as a complimentary meal from restaurant.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen"},{"id":"chefchaouen_wv_cafe_clock","areaId":"chefchaouen","name":"Cafe Clock","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.16957,"lng":-5.26298},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"chefchaouen_wv_cafe_clock","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafeclock","chefchaouen"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Cult cafe chain from Fes run by European. It occupies an entire four-floor riad, it has a roof-top terrace, nice atmosphere. This is the only place in Chaouen where you can try Moroccan rfissa.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen"},{"id":"chefchaouen_wv_chez_aziz_snack","areaId":"chefchaouen","name":"Chez Aziz snack","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.16835,"lng":-5.26492},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"chefchaouen_wv_chez_aziz_snack","tickets":[],"signal