 hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Meeting point for younger people. Great view from the terrace which overlooks central square and mountains. Food is average.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen"},{"id":"chefchaouen_wv_chez_foad","areaId":"chefchaouen","name":"Chez Foad","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.16991,"lng":-5.26167},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"chefchaouen_wv_chez_foad","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["chezfoad","chefchaouen"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Also do a great fish tajine, and a shrimp tajine, salad and cous-cous are also very good. Great relation quality/price.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen"},{"id":"chefchaouen_wv_restaurant_populaire_bab_ssour","areaId":"chefchaouen","name":"Restaurant Populaire Bab Ssour","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.16852,"lng":-5.26349},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"chefchaouen_wv_restaurant_populaire_bab_ssour","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://facebook.com/restaurant.bab.ssour","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["restaurantpopulairebabssour","chefchaouen"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Good food in a quiet room with a friendly owner. Many languages spoken. Good local cheese.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Chefchaouen"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts;